2026-07-27T05:34:11.9516434Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9517139Z i /tmp/RtmpkpI2ct/duckdb
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9517566Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9518047Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9518696Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9519149Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9519764Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9520251Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9713017Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:34:11.9804514Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:34:12.0116422Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:34:12.0221797Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
